  first | exact @GlobalTheory.Alc.eq_of_shifted_residues_eq | exact GlobalTheory.Alc.eq_of_shifted_residues_eq | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.Alc.eq_of_shifted_residues_eq <;> assumption)
